"","sm":"ALII"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au."}]},{"en":"And it came to pass after many days, that the LORD said unto me, Arise, go to Euphrates, and take the girdle from thence, which I commanded thee to hide there.","n":6,"sm":"Ua mavae aso e tele, ona faapea mai ai lea o le ALII ia te au, Ina tulai ia, alu i Eufirate, ma au mai ai le fusi na ou fai atu ai ia te ce e nana i lea mea.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"mavae"},{"en":"","sm":"aso"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tele,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"faapea"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au,"},{"en":"","sm":"Ina"},{"en":"","sm":"tulai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Eufirate,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fusi"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ce"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"nana"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"mea."}]},{"en":"Then I went to Euphrates, and digged, and took the girdle from the place where I had hid it: and, behold, the girdle was marred, it was profitable for nothing.","n":7,"sm":"Ona aʻu alu ai lea i Eufirate, ma afu eli, ma avae nai lea mea le fusi na ou nana ai; faauta foi, ua leaga le fusi, ua le aoga i se mea e tasi.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Eufirate,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"afu"},{"en":"","sm":"eli,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"avae"},{"en":"","sm":"nai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fusi"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","